# =====================
# THE MODULE REPO LAW (Q4 amended 2026-08-03)
# modules/ is the RUNTIME home of downloaded modules and module
# checkouts - module code never lands in this repository. Every
# module lives in its own repo (github.com/ccs-devhub/nano-module-*)
# and is developed there, cloned under modules/<name>. The three
# negations below are the legacy bundled modules, tracked until
# their eviction to their own repos is executed.
# =====================
modules/*
!modules/embed-styler/
!modules/synapse/
!modules/mcp/
